          "zh": "B：星期五前能回家吗？",
          "py": "B: Xīngqī wǔ qián néng huí jiā ma?",
          "en": "B: Can you come back before Friday?"
        },
        {
          "zh": "A：能。",
          "py": "A: Néng.",
          "en": "A: Yes, I can."
